    <string name="test_title">How to test</string>
    <string name="test_1">Keep Test mode on. Tap ARM, lock the phone.</string>
    <string name="test_2">Put it in your pocket. A short buzz means it\'s protected.</string>
    <string name="test_3">Pull it out without unlocking: beeps (in your earbuds if connected).</string>
    <string name="test_4">Wait: the quiet siren starts, the torch flashes, photos are taken.</string>
    <string name="test_5">Unlock with your fingerprint: everything stops and it re-arms.</string>
    <string name="test_6">Volume buttons during the siren shouldn\'t silence it.</string>
    <string name="test_7">Power-off protection on: arm, lock, hold power. The menu closes and the alarm starts.</string>
    <string name="test_8">Charging: arm, lock, unplug. Beeps, then the siren.</string>
    <string name="test_9">Add your number as a contact and check History after a test.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_skip">Skip</string>
