    <string name="onboarding_start">Get started</string>
    <string name="onboarding_1_title">Catch pickpockets in the act</string>
    <string name="onboarding_1_body">Pocket Guard screams the moment your phone leaves your pocket without your fingerprint, while the thief is still next to you.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_2_title">Arm it before the crowd</string>
    <string name="onboarding_2_body">Tap ARM or the Quick Settings tile, then pocket your phone. A short buzz means it\'s protected. Take it out and unlock as usual: nothing happens.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_3_title">If someone takes it</string>
    <string name="onboarding_3_body">Beeps in your earbuds, then a siren they can\'t silence. Your contacts get its location by SMS and the front camera photographs the thief.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_4_title">Set it up, then test it</string>
    <string name="onboarding_4_body">Go through the setup checklist so your phone never stops the guard. Test mode keeps the siren quiet while you try it.</string>
